      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Under CIF Incoterms 2020, the seller in South Korea is responsible for delivering the goods to the port of destination in Germany. This includes arranging and paying for the transportation and insuring the goods up to the named port. Importantly, the seller's responsibility transfers to the buyer once the goods are loaded onto the vessel at the port of origin.",
